[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Center Game"]
[Variation "Center Game: 4.Qc3 Bb4"]
[ECO "C22"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,pin,queen-trap"]
[Themes "pin-on-the-king,tempo-on-queen"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. d4 exd4 3. Qxd4 Nc6 4. Qc3"]
[For "black"]
[Kind "for-us"]
[Opponent "4.Qc3"]
[Start "centre-game-queen-takes 3...Nc6"]

4. Qc3 $2 { Moves the queen out of the knight's attack, but it lands on a diagonal the black bishop can reach. } 4... Bb4 { Pins the queen to the king, because White has no d-pawn to block. White loses the queen for a bishop. } 5. Bd2 ( 5. Qxb4 Nxb4 ) 5... Bxc3 6. Bxc3 Nf6 *
